    <title>Modifying the visual node representation</title>
  </head>
  <body bgcolor="#ffffff">
    <h1>
       <img border="0" hspace="0" s7starttagpos="296" height="32" width="32" src=
      "../../../../images/carmenHelpIcons/c3_32.gif">&nbsp;&nbsp; Modifying the visual node
      representation
    </h1>
    <table border="1" cellpadding="4" cellspacing="0" bordercolor="#000000" width="490">
      <col width="234">
      <col width="238">
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="480">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Use case: Modifying the visual node representation</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="480">
          <p align="justify">
             <b><font size="3">Comment:</font></b> <font size="3">In this case the user chooses the
            content that will appear within the network nodes currently selected, that is, their
            name or their title.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td colspan="2" valign="top" width="480">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Actor: User</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Normal course</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p align="left">
             <b><font size="3">Alternative courses</font></b>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">1.The user selects one of the options to see the nodes by their name or
            their title.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" class=
          "western" align="justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">2.In the current network the type of display for the nodes that already
            are and for new ones, is established.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">3.The option chosen by the user is marked on the menu.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
      <tr valign="top">
        <td width="234">
          <p align="justify">
             <font size="3">4.If the type of presentation has changed, the contents of the nodes is
            updated.</font>
          </p>
        </td>
        <td width="238">
          <p style=" margin-left: 1.25cm; margin-right: -0.02cm; text-indent: -0.79cm;" align=
          "justify">
             <font size="3"><br>
            </font>
          </p>
        </td>
      </tr>
    </table>
    <p>
       &nbsp;
    </p>
  </body>
